WEBVTT

00:12.000 --> 00:14.560
♪Trapped in this tiny world♪

00:15.040 --> 00:18.440
♪I'm crushed into dust♪

00:19.200 --> 00:23.000
♪I meddle around without any mercy♪

00:23.320 --> 00:26.160
♪I'm my own pawn♪

00:26.520 --> 00:30.360
♪I sigh at my fate♪

00:30.560 --> 00:35.360
♪Numerous people are under my control♪

00:38.040 --> 00:41.880
♪All the sand is washed away♪

00:44.280 --> 00:47.880
♪An old dream fades♪

00:50.200 --> 00:54.560
♪A bumpy path lies ahead♪

00:56.040 --> 00:58.880
♪Traps within traps, I never make mistakes♪

00:59.200 --> 01:02.000
♪I take a risk at every step♪

01:02.280 --> 01:07.400
♪Even in disputes, I break through with my life♪

01:07.880 --> 01:10.280
♪Schemes within schemes, I prison myself♪

01:10.520 --> 01:13.600
♪Each link swaps bluff and truth♪

01:13.920 --> 01:16.480
♪The world is my Weiqi game board♪

01:16.800 --> 01:22.120
♪Everything's just fleeting♪

01:23.720 --> 01:28.320
♪The play begins♪

01:30.280 --> 01:32.520
♪No return is expected♪

01:32.880 --> 01:37.880
♪The flame is gone, whether we win or lose♪

01:38.280 --> 01:40.360
♪The wind never ceases. I hold the reins♪

01:40.360 --> 01:41.510
[Ashes To Crown]

01:41.510 --> 01:45.680
[Adapted from Xixing's novel, Empress of the State of Chu]

01:46.470 --> 01:49.000
[Episode 19]

01:55.060 --> 01:56.740
Yanlai, you had a formidable presence

01:57.660 --> 01:58.620
at today's court.

02:01.980 --> 02:03.180
I personally decided to kill

02:03.620 --> 02:04.700
the Northern Desert King.

02:06.020 --> 02:07.660
But clearly, you won't regret it.

02:08.260 --> 02:09.100
Since childhood,

02:09.900 --> 02:10.740
have I ever said

02:10.740 --> 02:11.820
"regret"?

02:12.300 --> 02:13.500
You've made up your mind.

02:15.180 --> 02:16.060
I won't stop you.

02:17.780 --> 02:18.660
You can't stop me.

02:19.540 --> 02:20.740
Before you go,

02:22.100 --> 02:23.540
let's do something first.

02:25.460 --> 02:26.700
Your mother's tablet

02:27.220 --> 02:28.820
can be placed in our ancestral hall.

02:33.460 --> 02:34.180
What did you say?

02:36.500 --> 02:37.100
Yanlai,

02:39.300 --> 02:40.740
don't you always want her tablet

02:41.260 --> 02:42.020
to be placed there?

02:42.820 --> 02:43.900
Now is the perfect time.

02:45.100 --> 02:46.260
You'll enter the pedigree too.

02:47.100 --> 02:48.180
You and your mother

02:49.300 --> 02:50.060
will become

02:50.060 --> 02:51.580
rightful members of the Xie family.

03:02.060 --> 03:02.620
No need.

03:08.340 --> 03:10.540
Rightful identity...

03:12.740 --> 03:13.940
Recognition of the clan...

03:14.620 --> 03:15.900
Don't you want any?

03:16.220 --> 03:17.580
I used to think

03:18.100 --> 03:19.420
it was all I sought.

03:20.140 --> 03:20.940
But now...

03:21.860 --> 03:22.660
Now what?

03:24.020 --> 03:24.940
My mother doesn't need

03:24.940 --> 03:26.140
offerings of the Xie Family.

03:27.140 --> 03:28.380
And I don't need the recognition

03:28.980 --> 03:29.980
from the Xie's pedigree.

03:31.340 --> 03:33.140
Nor do I need a rightful identity.

03:34.540 --> 03:35.700
I know who I am

03:36.980 --> 03:38.420
and I know what I want.

03:39.780 --> 03:40.540
That's enough.

03:41.780 --> 03:43.460
After going through all this,

03:44.620 --> 03:46.460
you've really changed.

03:48.700 --> 03:49.900
Since you've made up your mind,

03:52.820 --> 03:53.380
so be it.

03:56.060 --> 03:56.580
Xie Yanfang.

04:00.020 --> 04:00.820
Five years ago,

04:02.220 --> 04:02.700
you gave me

04:02.700 --> 04:04.180
the Bloodburn Pill.

04:05.820 --> 04:06.580
Did you know

04:07.780 --> 04:08.780
anyone who took it

04:11.460 --> 04:12.140
would die?

04:21.500 --> 04:22.980
This secret elixir only belongs

04:22.980 --> 04:23.900
to our direct line.

04:25.380 --> 04:26.780
It can even revive the dying.

04:27.340 --> 04:28.540
Keep it with you

04:29.100 --> 04:30.260
in case of emergency.

04:57.220 --> 04:57.740
Yanlai.

05:05.820 --> 05:06.820
How do you know I'm here?

05:07.980 --> 05:08.940
You're my brother.

05:09.860 --> 05:11.500
Of course I keep track of where you go.

05:12.500 --> 05:13.380
I came here

05:14.180 --> 05:15.500
to take you back home.

05:18.700 --> 05:19.340
No need.

05:20.140 --> 05:20.940
Here in Yunzhong,

05:21.620 --> 05:23.460
people go through wind and sand.

05:24.700 --> 05:25.580
Living by one's ability

05:26.100 --> 05:26.660
isn't too bad.

05:27.260 --> 05:28.260
Young Master cares for you.

05:29.060 --> 05:30.140
How could you be ungrateful?

05:30.420 --> 05:31.020
You really think

05:31.020 --> 05:31.940
Chu Ling trusts you?

05:32.660 --> 05:33.900
If he knows you're a Xie,

05:34.060 --> 05:34.900
can you still stay?

05:35.220 --> 05:35.900
He wouldn't care.

05:37.500 --> 05:38.420
All he cares about

05:39.180 --> 05:40.340
is whether I can slay enemies

05:41.380 --> 05:42.740
and guard this place.

05:43.620 --> 05:45.100
He doesn't care

05:45.300 --> 05:45.940
who I really am.

05:46.860 --> 05:48.460
Chu Ling has 200,000 frontier troops.

05:49.300 --> 05:50.260
If he wants to kill you,

05:51.100 --> 05:52.780
you won't be able to resist.

05:53.780 --> 05:54.540
Will you gamble?

05:56.220 --> 05:57.420
I have nothing to lose.

05:58.780 --> 05:59.700
I don't care.

06:00.820 --> 06:02.380
So, this is your choice.

06:21.020 --> 06:22.100
If I say I didn't know,

06:24.340 --> 06:24.940
will you believe me?

06:56.740 --> 06:58.780
Xie Yanlai didn't tell his brother in advance.

06:59.180 --> 07:00.500
Xie Yanfang must be angry.

07:01.300 --> 07:01.980
Wrong.

07:02.860 --> 07:04.260
Xie Yanfang doesn't care

07:04.260 --> 07:06.220
whether he was informed in advance.

07:06.980 --> 07:08.460
He has raised too many lackeys.

07:09.180 --> 07:10.380
It's normal that one of them

07:11.340 --> 07:12.180
may betray him.

07:13.700 --> 07:14.540
What matters to him?

07:17.740 --> 07:19.500
Xie Yanlai has won successive exploits

07:19.820 --> 07:21.140
and enjoys supreme prestige.

07:21.780 --> 07:22.780
If it goes on like this,

07:23.820 --> 07:25.180
his reputation will

07:25.700 --> 07:27.420
overshadow Xie Yanfang's.

07:28.100 --> 07:29.380
That's exactly

07:29.980 --> 07:31.780
what Xie Yanfang won't allow to happen.

07:33.020 --> 07:33.780
It seems

07:34.660 --> 07:36.140
big changes are coming to his family.

07:36.620 --> 07:38.700
Don't underestimate Xie Yanfang.

07:39.620 --> 07:41.060
With his mastery of strategies,

07:41.460 --> 07:42.580
how would he not

07:42.580 --> 07:43.620
have a backup plan?

07:44.580 --> 07:46.740
There must still be room for a reversal.

07:47.820 --> 07:49.500
Let's not worry about them.

07:50.620 --> 07:52.460
Is everything ready for tonight's banquet?

07:53.380 --> 07:54.220
Rest assured.

07:55.140 --> 07:55.940
Everything is ready.

08:26.740 --> 08:28.180
We agreed on a hundred liang of gold.

08:28.540 --> 08:29.740
Why is it fifty now?

08:30.140 --> 08:32.020
If the boy weren't a Xie,

08:32.340 --> 08:34.060
I wouldn't have risked my life for him.

08:34.540 --> 08:35.980
You got fifty liang of gold

08:36.660 --> 08:38.340
for one single night.

08:38.660 --> 08:39.340
In my opinion,

08:39.620 --> 08:41.220
it's a good deal for you.

08:41.740 --> 08:42.660
That boy

08:42.900 --> 08:44.620
is the Xie's bloodline,

08:45.220 --> 08:46.140
but after all,

08:46.140 --> 08:47.500
he's an illegitimate child.

08:47.860 --> 08:48.660
Don't think

08:48.780 --> 08:50.180
he's very valuable.

08:51.100 --> 08:51.940
Send him back home

08:51.940 --> 08:53.100
as soon as you can.

08:53.620 --> 08:55.700
Don't delay my business tonight.

08:56.220 --> 08:56.820
Mother.

09:00.780 --> 09:01.420
Son,

09:02.020 --> 09:03.140
you've grown up.

09:03.220 --> 09:04.300
You should be sensible.

09:04.980 --> 09:07.060
The Xie Family is where you belong.

09:07.500 --> 09:08.020
From now on,

09:08.060 --> 09:09.460
you'll enjoy a great life

09:09.460 --> 09:10.220
and that's enough.

09:11.860 --> 09:12.940
Come on, you...

09:17.980 --> 09:19.940
Listen. Mother isn't leaving.

09:20.140 --> 09:20.980
Let go, will you?

09:21.820 --> 09:22.980
I'll go buy some fabrics

09:23.220 --> 09:24.220
to make you new clothes.

09:24.620 --> 09:25.620
I really won't leave.

09:25.620 --> 09:26.900
Look. It's getting late.

09:26.900 --> 09:28.140
The cloth shop will be closed.

09:29.540 --> 09:30.020
Good boy.

09:30.700 --> 09:31.420
Come on.

09:35.060 --> 09:36.060
Is he the ninth young master?

09:36.420 --> 09:37.020
That's right.

09:37.660 --> 09:39.060
Look. You're the young master now.

09:39.100 --> 09:40.380
How can you wear ragged clothes?

09:40.660 --> 09:42.300
I'll go make you some new clothes.

09:42.340 --> 09:42.900
Wait here.

09:47.620 --> 09:48.580
What is his name?

09:49.260 --> 09:49.860
Whatever.

09:49.940 --> 09:51.060
Call him anything you want.

10:04.220 --> 10:06.220
Mother, it's been long.

10:08.140 --> 10:09.020
When I was little,

10:11.420 --> 10:12.820
I thought you left for new clothes.

10:14.900 --> 10:16.340
So, I waited for you on the stairs

10:16.340 --> 10:16.980
of Xie Residence.

10:18.300 --> 10:19.300
I waited until night.

10:21.900 --> 10:23.300
Until my candied hawthorn melted.

10:27.380 --> 10:28.180
But I still failed

10:30.980 --> 10:32.220
to see you back.

10:34.660 --> 10:35.420
Later,

10:36.580 --> 10:37.940
they said you were a dirty woman

10:41.700 --> 10:42.780
and I was a courtesan's son.

10:44.180 --> 10:45.300
I studied really hard

10:46.580 --> 10:47.580
and learned martial arts.

10:49.100 --> 10:50.260
No matter how hard it was,

10:51.660 --> 10:52.500
it never felt bitter.

10:54.060 --> 10:54.980
I just wished

10:56.780 --> 10:58.100
that one day

10:59.780 --> 11:01.060
I could be a rightful member

11:01.060 --> 11:01.940
of the Xie Family.

11:06.300 --> 11:06.940
I wanted them

11:06.940 --> 11:08.020
to think highly of me.

11:09.980 --> 11:11.220
I also hoped

11:14.540 --> 11:16.100
that your tablet could be placed

11:16.780 --> 11:18.020
in their ancestral hall.

11:19.860 --> 11:20.660
To make this happen,

11:21.180 --> 11:22.060
I endured insults

11:22.860 --> 11:23.660
and risked my life.

11:25.300 --> 11:26.780
Even if I felt like a ghost there,

11:30.820 --> 11:32.420
I felt happier than being

11:33.260 --> 11:34.260
a wandering man as Fu Jiu.

11:34.980 --> 11:35.740
I used to think

11:35.740 --> 11:37.060
if I became successful,

11:37.900 --> 11:39.300
they wouldn't scorn us anymore.

11:39.660 --> 11:40.340
It turns out

11:40.660 --> 11:41.580
you abandoned me long ago.

11:42.380 --> 11:42.940
Right?

11:45.380 --> 11:46.620
I've never hated you.

11:48.380 --> 11:49.340
Even now,

11:51.380 --> 11:52.620
I still don't hate you.

11:55.380 --> 11:56.620
You suffered pains when bearing me.

11:58.100 --> 11:59.300
You pulled through when raising me.

12:01.140 --> 12:01.900
Maybe

12:04.300 --> 12:05.900
on the day you left me,

12:10.140 --> 12:11.460
you cried hard too.

12:14.340 --> 12:14.860
Right?

12:15.420 --> 12:16.580
I've figured out one thing.

12:17.580 --> 12:18.900
We can't get everything

12:18.900 --> 12:20.220
even if we fight for it.

12:20.580 --> 12:21.020
Mother,

12:22.300 --> 12:23.340
I met someone.

12:27.900 --> 12:29.420
The most important person in my life.

12:33.540 --> 12:34.340
Her name is Zhao.

12:36.540 --> 12:37.780
She makes me understand

12:40.340 --> 12:42.060
a rightful identity doesn't matter.

12:44.020 --> 12:44.900
I am who I am.

12:47.700 --> 12:48.900
And I am your son.

12:54.780 --> 12:55.300
Jiu.

12:59.500 --> 13:00.340
Don't be sad.

13:12.820 --> 13:13.740
It's strange.

13:14.860 --> 13:16.100
Before, as Xie Yanlai,

13:16.980 --> 13:17.980
you would disdain

13:19.300 --> 13:20.940
and reject such useless comfort.

13:23.380 --> 13:24.660
But now, as Fu Jiu,

13:26.100 --> 13:27.860
you must want to hear this:

13:35.060 --> 13:35.940
"Don't be sad."

13:51.180 --> 13:51.980
I didn't expect this

13:56.500 --> 13:57.380
because I dared not.

14:00.940 --> 14:01.740
Nor could I get any.

14:04.700 --> 14:05.860
The rightful identity

14:09.300 --> 14:10.180
and the family love

14:13.060 --> 14:14.020
were out of my reach.

14:19.820 --> 14:21.500
So, I had to pretend I didn't want any.

14:25.180 --> 14:26.460
Only in this way could I relieve

14:27.620 --> 14:28.420
the pain and shame

14:31.220 --> 14:32.260
in my heart.

14:35.340 --> 14:36.100
But now,

14:37.740 --> 14:38.580
no need for that.

14:49.820 --> 14:50.340
Yeah.

14:51.300 --> 14:52.060
No need for that.

14:53.060 --> 14:54.140
Now I know who I am.

14:56.980 --> 14:58.060
Whether Xie Yanlai

14:58.860 --> 14:59.580
or Fu Jiu,

15:00.700 --> 15:01.540
I'm just myself.

15:03.620 --> 15:04.700
You're my man.

15:06.020 --> 15:07.020
In life,

15:08.700 --> 15:10.100
having the freedom to choose

15:11.380 --> 15:12.740
is already the greatest happiness.

15:15.300 --> 15:16.740
You're good as you are.

15:18.260 --> 15:19.100
But now,

15:20.060 --> 15:21.060
you're always hindered.

15:22.420 --> 15:23.380
If I kill the King,

15:24.340 --> 15:25.220
the problem will be solved.

15:26.580 --> 15:27.780
That's my problem.

15:31.300 --> 15:32.500
Why didn't you tell me

15:33.180 --> 15:34.780
before you made that decision?

15:35.140 --> 15:35.980
No need.

15:38.300 --> 15:39.500
You wouldn't let me go.

15:40.100 --> 15:41.180
My father and the King

15:41.180 --> 15:42.100
fought for over a decade.

15:42.740 --> 15:43.900
Do you know how hard...?

15:44.700 --> 15:45.180
Zhao,

15:45.500 --> 15:46.060
I know.

15:46.940 --> 15:47.740
You worry about me.

15:49.260 --> 15:50.020
But this time,

15:50.740 --> 15:52.100
let me do something for you.

16:14.860 --> 16:15.740
According to Father,

16:16.860 --> 16:17.580
the armor

16:18.580 --> 16:20.340
is a soldier's second life.

16:23.260 --> 16:24.540
You never wore it before

16:25.820 --> 16:27.660
because you thought your life

16:28.340 --> 16:29.140
wasn't worth it.

16:31.700 --> 16:32.420
Now,

16:34.540 --> 16:35.700
I want you to put it on.

16:37.580 --> 16:38.460
I want you to know

16:39.540 --> 16:41.020
I'm waiting for you to return alive.

16:43.060 --> 16:44.380
Just like how my father

16:45.740 --> 16:47.620
took you out of the desert alive.

16:53.620 --> 16:57.460
♪Broken walls and withered branches, trapped in the mire♪

16:58.460 --> 16:58.940
All right.

17:02.380 --> 17:03.140
You make a vow.

17:07.420 --> 17:08.340
Make it to my father.

17:08.780 --> 17:11.140
♪Through biting winds and frost I go♪

17:11.500 --> 17:13.820
♪I light a lamp, my lone abode♪

17:14.460 --> 17:15.820
♪Half my life adrift♪

17:16.300 --> 17:20.100
♪This lonely shadow finds no haven to moor♪

17:22.340 --> 17:24.340
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

17:24.620 --> 17:26.420
♪And roars in the blaze♪

17:26.460 --> 17:29.500
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

17:29.860 --> 17:30.740
I give you my word.

17:32.940 --> 17:34.100
I will come back alive.

17:37.140 --> 17:41.420
♪Even if hope is faint, I remain proud♪

17:42.940 --> 17:43.860
You must not lie to me.

17:49.220 --> 17:50.940
I swear to General Chu's armor.

17:51.220 --> 17:52.940
♪With no fear of the distance♪

17:54.180 --> 17:55.100
I will stay alive

17:56.980 --> 17:58.100
and return the armor to him.

18:01.780 --> 18:06.260
♪Let these scars all over me become♪

18:06.660 --> 18:10.660
♪My new pride♪

18:29.220 --> 18:30.340
Xie Yanlai has become

18:30.340 --> 18:31.340
even more uncontrollable.

18:31.860 --> 18:32.940
At today's court,

18:32.940 --> 18:33.940
he made a military vow

18:34.340 --> 18:35.700
to kill the Northern Desert King.

18:36.220 --> 18:37.540
Ministers were stunned.

18:40.180 --> 18:41.740
He's never a caged bird.

18:43.540 --> 18:44.820
Now that he's strong enough,

18:46.740 --> 18:47.940
he will surely leave.

18:50.620 --> 18:51.460
That man...

18:52.860 --> 18:53.500
He's back, huh?

18:54.140 --> 18:54.900
Yes, in the city.

18:55.660 --> 18:57.460
I heard he had great prestige

18:58.460 --> 18:59.460
among frontier troops.

19:00.300 --> 19:01.380
Glad to hear that.

19:03.420 --> 19:04.180
I think it's time

19:04.180 --> 19:05.540
to have the next general

19:07.060 --> 19:07.780
take the stage.

19:24.740 --> 19:25.940
Mr. Liang is back.

19:27.060 --> 19:28.260
He's back.

19:29.100 --> 19:29.700
Come on.

19:30.900 --> 19:31.460
Mr. Liang,

19:31.620 --> 19:32.540
you're finally back.

19:33.220 --> 19:34.220
Not Mr. Liang.

19:34.460 --> 19:35.860
Now, he's General Liang.

19:36.260 --> 19:38.620
The Roving General titled by His Majesty.

19:40.780 --> 19:41.460
And you are?

19:42.060 --> 19:42.700
General Liang,

19:42.740 --> 19:44.420
I'm Huang.

19:44.820 --> 19:45.340
General,

19:45.580 --> 19:46.420
why didn't you

19:46.420 --> 19:47.060
tell us before?

19:47.260 --> 19:47.660
We could

19:47.820 --> 19:49.020
have welcomed you from afar.

19:49.100 --> 19:49.940
- Yeah. - Yeah.

19:50.060 --> 19:50.700
That's right.

19:50.820 --> 19:52.060
You're the hero

19:52.180 --> 19:53.180
of our clan.

19:53.380 --> 19:54.180
Don't stand here.

19:54.220 --> 19:54.860
Let's get in.

19:54.860 --> 19:55.980
Yeah. Come in, please.

19:56.380 --> 19:56.860
Get in.

19:57.140 --> 19:57.620
Come on.

19:57.820 --> 19:58.340
This way.

19:58.860 --> 19:59.300
Hurry.

20:10.300 --> 20:10.780
Father.

20:12.180 --> 20:12.660
Mother.

20:15.260 --> 20:17.020
I've only been a general for half a day.

20:19.060 --> 20:20.100
But visitors

20:20.100 --> 20:21.300
have already flooded in.

20:23.100 --> 20:24.380
Many relatives and friends

20:25.500 --> 20:27.340
were popping up.

20:31.700 --> 20:33.260
They greeted me warmly

20:35.180 --> 20:36.380
and shed tears

20:38.340 --> 20:39.660
for seeing me again.

20:41.340 --> 20:42.540
Actually,

20:42.540 --> 20:43.580
I barely remember them.

20:46.020 --> 20:46.860
It doesn't matter.

21:00.620 --> 21:01.340
Soon,

21:02.580 --> 21:04.180
everyone in the Capital will know

21:04.900 --> 21:05.700
I can bring glory

21:06.980 --> 21:08.780
to the Liang Family.

21:52.660 --> 21:53.620
The honey filling

21:53.620 --> 21:54.740
is overflowing.

21:55.020 --> 21:55.940
Way too sweet.

21:56.540 --> 21:57.660
Is it for Commander Xie?

21:58.180 --> 21:58.580
Oh no.

21:58.940 --> 22:00.460
It's for General Fu Jiu, right?

22:01.900 --> 22:03.580
His journey is really concerning.

22:05.060 --> 22:06.380
Shall I divine for him?

22:06.860 --> 22:07.380
No need.

22:08.980 --> 22:10.060
He never believes in fate.

22:14.300 --> 22:14.940
Letter from the Stronghold.

22:15.420 --> 22:16.420
They found the old file

22:16.420 --> 22:16.980
of Xiaonan caravan.

22:30.260 --> 22:30.740
As expected,

22:31.420 --> 22:32.740
three months before the fire,

22:33.180 --> 22:34.820
they passed the village six times.

22:36.260 --> 22:37.620
Why did you suddenly investigate

22:37.620 --> 22:38.500
such an old case?

22:38.980 --> 22:39.700
Jiu figured out

22:40.420 --> 22:42.540
the fire resulted from fire oil.

22:43.020 --> 22:44.380
It might be transported

22:44.380 --> 22:45.820
for the Northern Desert.

22:48.340 --> 22:49.660
Judging from the file,

22:50.220 --> 22:52.300
this caravan passed six times.

22:53.020 --> 22:54.220
But every time they carried

22:54.260 --> 22:55.180
very few goods.

22:55.700 --> 22:56.780
That wasn't something

22:56.780 --> 22:57.940
a normal caravan

22:57.940 --> 22:58.900
would do.

23:00.060 --> 23:01.180
It had to be something else.

23:02.100 --> 23:03.060
What could it be?

23:03.820 --> 23:05.820
Wei Village only had dozens of villagers

23:06.100 --> 23:07.660
and uninhabited wilderness.

23:08.100 --> 23:09.380
What could they be up to?

23:11.460 --> 23:12.700
So, Jiu was right.

23:14.580 --> 23:16.060
Northern Desert foes conspired with Xiaonan

23:16.100 --> 23:17.100
to burn the Wei Village

23:18.260 --> 23:20.020
with an aim at Cangmu Stronghold,

23:22.060 --> 23:22.820
to be exact,

23:23.740 --> 23:24.540
my mother.

23:26.860 --> 23:27.700
To reveal

23:27.700 --> 23:28.940
my mother was an enemy general

23:30.180 --> 23:31.340
would be the best weapon

23:31.340 --> 23:32.340
against my father.

23:33.180 --> 23:34.140
In that case,

23:34.940 --> 23:35.860
frontier troops would

23:36.100 --> 23:36.980
have a new master.

23:39.300 --> 23:40.180
That would benefit

23:41.340 --> 23:42.180
Xiaonan

23:43.340 --> 23:44.780
and the Northern Desert.

23:46.540 --> 23:47.540
Xiao Xun and his father

23:47.540 --> 23:48.860
even struck a deal with evil enemies.

23:49.700 --> 23:51.060
Then we'll let them know

23:52.900 --> 23:55.340
how it feels to be devoured by their own ambition.

24:20.740 --> 24:21.700
Why are we meeting here?

24:24.020 --> 24:25.060
Because your girl

24:26.260 --> 24:27.860
has a lot to say to you.

24:29.540 --> 24:30.900
But a princess can't say that.

24:34.380 --> 24:35.300
More maltose was used.

24:36.980 --> 24:37.500
It's sweeter.

24:39.140 --> 24:39.660
You made it?

24:45.340 --> 24:46.540
It feels sweet enough just looking at it.

24:48.300 --> 24:48.980
Jiu,

24:49.460 --> 24:50.940
you've picked up sweet talk.

24:54.180 --> 24:54.940
I can do more

24:56.540 --> 24:57.700
than you think I can.

25:01.220 --> 25:02.060
You must eat it.

25:03.220 --> 25:04.060
I made it overnight.

25:08.740 --> 25:10.180
I've never seen you in armor before.

25:11.020 --> 25:12.340
What a young general.

25:13.420 --> 25:14.460
You look so gallant.

25:15.620 --> 25:17.180
No wonder the ladies in Yunzhong

25:18.340 --> 25:19.620
compliment your looks.

25:28.540 --> 25:29.940
Their compliments aren't

25:31.540 --> 25:32.540
as sweet as yours.

25:34.820 --> 25:35.580
And they aren't

25:38.620 --> 25:39.380
as pretty as you.

25:50.740 --> 25:51.620
Don't forget

25:52.860 --> 25:53.900
what you promised me.

26:03.060 --> 26:03.620
I won't.

26:07.900 --> 26:08.620
When I'm back,

26:10.100 --> 26:10.900
I'll return it.

26:13.020 --> 26:13.620
Return?

26:15.460 --> 26:16.260
Both.

26:18.420 --> 26:19.340
The armor and me.

26:20.260 --> 26:20.980
If you doubt it...

26:22.060 --> 26:22.860
Words are no proof.

26:26.380 --> 26:27.260
Let this be my pledge.

26:40.220 --> 26:44.300
♪Light shatters into silhouettes♪

26:44.940 --> 26:50.620
♪A lingering mark on my palm♪

26:51.420 --> 26:56.620
♪Hooves thunder through the ashes of war♪

26:56.820 --> 27:02.060
♪Riding the wild wind straight into the dawn♪

27:04.460 --> 27:07.060
♪A vivid life♪

27:07.260 --> 27:09.500
♪Bathed in tears♪

27:10.180 --> 27:13.140
♪Surging toward the dawn♪

27:14.060 --> 27:18.580
♪Let it burn until there's nothing left♪

27:19.140 --> 27:21.620
♪We crown our pain like glory♪

27:21.940 --> 27:24.700
♪Give that long-held wish a chance♪

27:25.660 --> 27:30.180
♪Let's run straight into the ruins♪

27:30.540 --> 27:33.580
♪I'd spend the rest of my life with you♪

27:33.620 --> 27:36.500
♪Even if longing turns to ash♪

27:36.540 --> 27:38.620
♪I'd still feel no fear♪

27:43.860 --> 27:46.340
♪Drifting through♪

27:49.980 --> 27:50.500
Zhao,

27:51.820 --> 27:52.980
you were meant

27:54.540 --> 27:55.620
to soar up there.

27:56.540 --> 27:57.020
And my role

27:58.380 --> 27:59.700
is to uphold you.

27:59.700 --> 28:02.020
♪Let scars soothe the soul♪

28:02.340 --> 28:05.460
♪So the last spark won't fade away♪

28:06.100 --> 28:10.620
♪Let's run toward the story's end♪

28:10.980 --> 28:13.660
♪And write a dream we're lost within♪

28:14.060 --> 28:16.780
♪As love engraves the passing years♪

28:16.820 --> 28:18.780
♪Into a timeless monument♪

28:19.300 --> 28:19.900
Tang,

28:20.340 --> 28:21.340
why did you come to me?

28:22.100 --> 28:22.980
Are you going

28:24.220 --> 28:25.540
to see your parents?

28:29.940 --> 28:30.500
Zhao,

28:31.580 --> 28:33.260
I used to think

28:33.620 --> 28:35.420
manipulating the court like you

28:35.620 --> 28:36.940
would be truly great.

28:37.860 --> 28:39.860
And after going through various schemes,

28:40.220 --> 28:41.180
I realized

28:41.660 --> 28:42.580
to be a hero

28:42.780 --> 28:43.700
was the real thrill.

28:44.660 --> 28:45.180
However,

28:46.260 --> 28:48.140
it might not be right for me.

28:53.700 --> 28:56.500
Since I was little, I've dreamed of having a good husband

28:57.380 --> 28:58.580
and living a life

28:58.780 --> 28:59.780
inside my house

28:59.820 --> 29:01.180
as a good wife and mother.

29:02.700 --> 29:03.460
But now,

29:03.580 --> 29:04.540
I've changed my mind.

29:05.620 --> 29:06.860
It's because of you.

29:07.780 --> 29:08.540
You've taught me.

29:09.060 --> 29:10.260
Even if

29:11.100 --> 29:11.820
we're women,

29:12.460 --> 29:13.700
we can still do a lot.

29:16.020 --> 29:16.980
Even though

29:17.020 --> 29:18.900
I can't become an official,

29:19.660 --> 29:20.780
the world is big enough

29:21.300 --> 29:22.700
and I can go out to experience it.

29:30.860 --> 29:31.260
Here.

29:35.940 --> 29:37.060
Recent literary gatherings

29:37.780 --> 29:38.980
make me understand.

29:39.940 --> 29:40.820
Giving chances

29:40.820 --> 29:42.140
to ladies like me

29:42.660 --> 29:44.180
for them to shine

29:45.220 --> 29:46.540
makes me even happier

29:46.620 --> 29:47.900
than my own glory.

29:49.260 --> 29:50.060
So,

29:50.220 --> 29:51.180
I intend to introduce

29:51.540 --> 29:52.940
literary gatherings elsewhere

29:53.580 --> 29:55.180
to enlighten more ladies.

29:56.060 --> 29:56.660
They don't need

29:57.660 --> 29:59.340
to live within others' expectations.

30:00.620 --> 30:01.220
They

30:01.900 --> 30:03.100
deserve the world

30:03.420 --> 30:04.500
of their own.

30:10.100 --> 30:11.020
Then this world

30:12.580 --> 30:14.060
will shine because of you.

30:24.060 --> 30:24.900
Did you just

30:24.900 --> 30:26.300
let Xie Yanlai go?

30:28.540 --> 30:29.460
Don't be silly.

30:31.300 --> 30:33.140
A lot of people in the court

30:33.940 --> 30:34.780
want Xie Yanlai dead.

30:35.540 --> 30:36.980
I don't have to do anything.

30:40.580 --> 30:41.260
For example?

30:41.860 --> 30:42.780
Don't you remember?

30:44.860 --> 30:45.700
The famous gentleman

30:45.700 --> 30:47.820
of the Xie Family.

30:48.020 --> 30:49.220
Do you mean

30:49.780 --> 30:50.580
Xie Yanfang?

30:51.020 --> 30:52.180
It can't be that easy to kill

30:52.180 --> 30:52.980
the Northern Desert King.

30:53.700 --> 30:54.700
Chu Ling couldn't do that

30:54.740 --> 30:55.900
within 20 years on the frontier.

30:56.820 --> 30:57.820
How can Xie Yanlai do it?

30:58.580 --> 31:00.220
What if Xie Yanlai

31:00.860 --> 31:01.860
really succeeds?

31:03.900 --> 31:05.140
Then he can't live.

31:07.700 --> 31:08.540
A lackey

31:08.540 --> 31:09.780
who only takes orders

31:10.580 --> 31:11.380
betrayed his master

31:11.380 --> 31:12.700
twice in a row.

31:13.780 --> 31:15.220
Xie Yanfang won't let him live.

31:16.740 --> 31:18.140
In the Xie Family,

31:19.220 --> 31:20.980
Xie Yanlai has been abandoned.

31:51.820 --> 31:52.580
Why again?

31:53.940 --> 31:55.180
I wanted to divine for General.

31:55.660 --> 31:57.660
But Her Highness told me

31:58.460 --> 31:59.620
he didn't believe in this.

31:59.820 --> 32:00.660
Then don't do that.

32:00.860 --> 32:01.380
But...

32:03.940 --> 32:05.180
What lies ahead is dangerous.

32:05.900 --> 32:07.180
And Her Highness made a vow.

32:07.660 --> 32:08.780
When she's the Grand Princess,

32:09.180 --> 32:11.140
she won't marry or have children.

32:11.620 --> 32:12.700
Then, her power

32:12.700 --> 32:13.500
won't fall to anyone

32:13.620 --> 32:14.700
or benefit anyone.

32:15.060 --> 32:16.060
If she breaks her vow...

32:17.620 --> 32:19.300
What if Her Highness falls for him

32:19.540 --> 32:20.580
and her vow comes true?

32:20.900 --> 32:22.140
Then don't divine.

32:23.700 --> 32:25.500
Who says a princess can't love?

32:26.380 --> 32:27.220
It makes sense.

32:28.300 --> 32:29.060
As the saying goes,

32:29.540 --> 32:31.220
love is bound by destiny.

32:31.740 --> 32:32.900
In love,

32:33.220 --> 32:34.380
no one can be forced.

32:34.660 --> 32:35.660
Nor can anyone

32:36.900 --> 32:38.220
run away from it.

32:40.740 --> 32:41.820
But the state matters.

32:42.580 --> 32:43.460
So do the people.

32:44.820 --> 32:47.860
They weigh more than romance.

32:48.700 --> 32:50.060
But if you have to

32:50.060 --> 32:50.820
cage your heart,

32:51.140 --> 32:51.580
what...

32:52.220 --> 32:54.100
What's the difference from being a puppet?

32:59.900 --> 33:00.620
Difference?

33:01.900 --> 33:02.900
The difference is...

33:03.220 --> 33:04.340
A puppet has no choice.

33:05.140 --> 33:05.780
But I

33:07.140 --> 33:08.580
have the power to choose.

33:10.460 --> 33:11.620
He went to war for me.

33:12.700 --> 33:13.860
Then I'll guard the court.

33:15.820 --> 33:16.660
I will

33:17.100 --> 33:18.140
protect the state.

33:19.300 --> 33:20.940
And I'll make it impregnable.

33:22.540 --> 33:24.580
Then the one I love can be safe.

33:26.220 --> 33:26.700
This is

33:28.220 --> 33:29.340
my choice.

33:35.660 --> 33:38.260
After the siege, Wangcheng

33:38.820 --> 33:40.660
was in ruins, awaiting revival.

33:41.180 --> 33:42.580
The court took it seriously

33:43.180 --> 33:45.980
and opened up Wangcheng trade route.

33:46.260 --> 33:47.420
In that case, we need

33:48.460 --> 33:49.740
a supervisor of the Maritime Trade Office

33:50.300 --> 33:51.300
for commercial affairs.

33:51.980 --> 33:52.820
This supervisor

33:53.700 --> 33:54.900
must excel in frontier trade.

33:55.180 --> 33:56.740
Mr. Xie, since we have candidates,

33:57.740 --> 33:59.220
why don't we recommend them

34:00.180 --> 34:01.780
for His Majesty to choose from?

34:02.940 --> 34:05.460
I recommend Zhao Su, pupil of the Xie Family.

34:05.940 --> 34:07.740
He knows trade routes very well.

34:08.100 --> 34:10.340
I recommend Zhou Ming, pupil of Mr. Deng.

34:10.740 --> 34:12.180
He was in charge of water transport.

34:12.820 --> 34:13.860
This is a serious matter.

34:14.740 --> 34:17.260
We request Your Majesty and Your Highness to make the decision.

34:18.300 --> 34:19.420
Mr. Deng and Mr. Xie

34:19.460 --> 34:20.620
are important ministers.

34:21.220 --> 34:22.580
Their pupils have unique talents.

34:23.340 --> 34:25.020
How about they take charge together?

34:26.060 --> 34:27.460
Zhou Ming, Mr. Deng's pupil,

34:27.820 --> 34:28.820
excels in finance.

34:29.460 --> 34:30.940
Zhao Su, Mr. Xie's pupil,

34:31.340 --> 34:32.300
knows frontier trade.

34:33.340 --> 34:34.220
Balancing each other,

34:34.740 --> 34:35.780
they're a perfect match.

34:36.780 --> 34:37.660
I approve.

34:38.020 --> 34:38.540
Hereby,

34:38.580 --> 34:39.700
Zhou Ming and Zhao Su

34:40.020 --> 34:41.740
take charge of frontier trade taxes

34:42.140 --> 34:43.700
and customs clearance.

34:45.260 --> 34:46.860
Let me add one more thing.

34:47.940 --> 34:50.300
Wangcheng trade route concerns frontier defense.

34:51.460 --> 34:52.420
I propose

34:52.780 --> 34:53.860
that special goods

34:54.220 --> 34:56.020
can't be transported

34:56.100 --> 34:57.060
without my approval.

34:57.620 --> 34:58.980
What are the special goods

34:58.980 --> 35:00.620
Your Highness is talking about?

35:01.900 --> 35:02.740
Fire oil.

35:16.780 --> 35:17.340
Your Highness,

35:18.060 --> 35:18.740
Chu Zhao got

35:19.060 --> 35:19.780
our old ledgers

35:19.780 --> 35:21.100
by some means.

35:21.780 --> 35:23.100
At today's court, she proposed

35:23.300 --> 35:24.180
transport of fire oil

35:24.620 --> 35:25.940
should need her approval.

35:26.460 --> 35:27.500
How on earth

35:27.500 --> 35:28.460
did she learn of this?

35:29.780 --> 35:30.900
Didn't I tell you?

35:31.380 --> 35:32.100
Nothing shall

35:32.540 --> 35:33.740
go wrong with the ledgers!

35:34.380 --> 35:34.980
Your Highness,

35:35.700 --> 35:36.420
Chu Zhao sent men

35:36.580 --> 35:37.460
to watch us closely.

35:37.940 --> 35:39.260
We really can't guard against her.

35:40.540 --> 35:41.900
She made one move after another

35:43.100 --> 35:44.900
just to make me panic.

35:45.820 --> 35:46.700
We'll set this aside

35:47.620 --> 35:48.500
for now.

35:49.420 --> 35:49.900
You...

35:50.460 --> 35:52.140
Send men to monitor Mr. Deng's mansion.

35:52.940 --> 35:53.700
Anything suspicious

35:53.940 --> 35:54.620
will be reported!

35:56.260 --> 35:57.140
Deng Yi

35:58.540 --> 36:00.180
is our last card.

36:01.260 --> 36:02.900
Nothing shall go wrong with him!

36:03.900 --> 36:04.820
I'm on it.

36:14.500 --> 36:16.180
Her Highness titled Mu Xiaoman

36:16.420 --> 36:18.300
Commander of the Imperial Guard Office?

36:21.260 --> 36:22.380
At today's court,

36:22.380 --> 36:23.100
you mentioned fire oil.

36:23.700 --> 36:24.860
I guess Xiao Xun will soon

36:25.020 --> 36:25.860
lose his composure.

36:27.940 --> 36:29.980
My goal is to make him panic.

36:31.020 --> 36:31.460
Look.

36:32.300 --> 36:33.500
Only six hours later,

36:34.220 --> 36:36.300
he sent his men to Mr. Deng's mansion.

36:37.820 --> 36:38.820
He wants Deng Yi to help?

36:39.820 --> 36:41.420
Deng Yi is in deep trouble himself,

36:41.620 --> 36:42.700
crushed by Xie Yanfang.

36:44.460 --> 36:46.260
So, Mr. Deng is looking for a solution.

36:47.140 --> 36:49.180
The 25 guests for his banquet

36:49.460 --> 36:50.420
are powerful officers

36:50.860 --> 36:51.420
like commandants,

36:51.780 --> 36:53.780
captains, and adjutant generals.

36:54.820 --> 36:55.700
He's a civil officer,

36:56.060 --> 36:56.860
but has a sharp eye.

36:58.060 --> 36:58.740
He's scared.

36:59.700 --> 37:01.380
Xie Yanfang holds military power.

37:02.060 --> 37:03.820
I command frontier troops.

37:04.540 --> 37:05.660
He needs to find

37:05.660 --> 37:06.540
some biting fighters

37:07.300 --> 37:08.620
to prevent himself

37:09.020 --> 37:10.100
from being eliminated.

37:10.860 --> 37:12.020
These are their attendants,

37:12.580 --> 37:13.980
including personal servants,

37:14.020 --> 37:14.820
guards, and carters.

37:15.220 --> 37:16.020
Seventy-two in total.

37:17.580 --> 37:18.060
Oh.

37:18.620 --> 37:20.540
The new Roving General Liang Qiang

37:20.860 --> 37:21.740
was also invited

37:21.740 --> 37:22.540
to that banquet.

37:23.260 --> 37:24.420
When he was at the frontier,

37:25.100 --> 37:26.540
he had an unusual promotion.

37:27.700 --> 37:28.740
At that time, I guessed

37:28.740 --> 37:29.820
he had some backing.

37:30.660 --> 37:31.820
So, it's Mr. Deng.

37:33.540 --> 37:34.500
Wise choice.

37:35.380 --> 37:37.580
Why did Deng Yi choose Liang Qiang?

37:38.820 --> 37:39.620
Back then,

37:39.700 --> 37:40.420
he was merely

37:40.420 --> 37:41.340
a soldier at Wangcheng.

37:41.660 --> 37:42.460
He had no power.

37:42.660 --> 37:44.100
Just because he was a mere soldier,

37:44.260 --> 37:45.180
he was more eager

37:45.260 --> 37:46.740
to get promoted by any means.

37:47.900 --> 37:48.540
Besides,

37:49.180 --> 37:50.660
he wasn't a mere soldier.

37:53.340 --> 37:55.140
His clan was involved with the Third Prince.

37:55.660 --> 37:56.820
That was a big clan.

37:57.260 --> 37:59.700
But they were exiled for taking the wrong side.

38:00.420 --> 38:00.940
He turned

38:00.940 --> 38:02.380
from a rich young man

38:02.580 --> 38:03.740
into a frontier soldier,

38:04.420 --> 38:05.860
how would he not resent it

38:06.460 --> 38:06.980
or hate it?

38:07.660 --> 38:09.020
Resentment and hatred

38:09.900 --> 38:10.740
lead to ambitions.

38:11.140 --> 38:11.620
Exactly.

38:13.340 --> 38:14.140
Once a man like him

38:14.780 --> 38:16.100
gets a glimmer of hope,

38:16.380 --> 38:17.700
he'll seize the chance

38:18.260 --> 38:19.220
and even

38:19.660 --> 38:20.580
work with the devil.

38:21.020 --> 38:22.380
So there's so much

38:22.500 --> 38:23.580
in court politics.

38:24.620 --> 38:25.620
I must learn carefully

38:25.620 --> 38:26.340
from Your Highness.

38:30.540 --> 38:31.060
Your Highness,

38:31.500 --> 38:32.740
have some tea I made.

38:42.300 --> 38:42.900
Any more intel?

38:43.300 --> 38:44.260
The relationships

38:44.620 --> 38:45.460
in Mr. Deng's family

38:45.460 --> 38:46.420
and his guests' family.

38:47.060 --> 38:48.260
Time was too short.

38:48.340 --> 38:49.100
It's not detailed.

38:55.340 --> 38:56.940
Four horses

38:56.980 --> 38:57.780
and five carriages.

38:58.700 --> 38:59.780
Even the number of trees

38:59.780 --> 39:00.660
is recorded.

39:01.060 --> 39:02.140
It's not detailed?

39:03.380 --> 39:04.020
Xiaoman,

39:04.620 --> 39:06.060
so besides fighting,

39:06.340 --> 39:07.060
you're also great

39:07.060 --> 39:07.860
at other things.

39:08.620 --> 39:10.260
I should learn from you.

39:11.220 --> 39:12.340
It's nothing.

39:12.860 --> 39:13.300
When I was

39:13.300 --> 39:14.380
at Cangmu Stronghold,

39:14.660 --> 39:15.940
I scouted before taking action.

39:16.220 --> 39:17.420
The size of the family,

39:17.460 --> 39:18.260
the location of door and window...

39:18.540 --> 39:19.700
Warehouses, and carriages...

39:19.820 --> 39:20.860
All information was needed.

39:22.140 --> 39:23.660
I thought you couldn't handle this.

39:23.980 --> 39:25.020
I underestimated you.

39:25.940 --> 39:27.180
Most of the conversations

39:27.180 --> 39:28.020
at Mr. Deng's banquet

39:28.380 --> 39:29.380
have been recorded.

39:30.180 --> 39:32.300
But we failed to eavesdrop

39:32.740 --> 39:34.740
on confidential conversations.

39:35.500 --> 39:36.860
You just started doing this.

39:37.140 --> 39:37.700
No hurry.

39:37.900 --> 39:38.500
Take your time.

39:39.300 --> 39:40.060
Now, you command

39:40.340 --> 39:41.660
seven hundred guards

39:41.660 --> 39:42.860
of the Imperial Guard Office.

39:43.300 --> 39:44.860
You supervise on my orders.

39:45.460 --> 39:46.340
You act discreetly

39:46.380 --> 39:47.700
just to avoid disturbing people

39:47.980 --> 39:49.380
and causing unnecessary trouble.

39:50.060 --> 39:51.340
But even if you're caught,

39:51.860 --> 39:52.780
you don't need to flee.

39:53.820 --> 39:54.260
I got it.

39:54.780 --> 39:55.300
Besides,

39:56.260 --> 39:57.420
I set up the Imperial Guard Office,

39:57.620 --> 39:59.100
so that you can openly command

39:59.140 --> 40:00.580
some of the Longwei Army.

40:01.060 --> 40:01.820
Actually, there is

40:01.820 --> 40:02.740
a bigger purpose.

40:03.940 --> 40:04.700
Monitor every move

40:04.700 --> 40:06.460
of the frontier troops

40:06.820 --> 40:08.380
and report it to me immediately.

40:09.860 --> 40:10.860
You're doing this

40:11.180 --> 40:11.860
for Xie Yanlai,

40:11.860 --> 40:12.740
aren't you?

40:13.260 --> 40:14.140
To clear the obstacles

40:14.140 --> 40:15.380
from his killing mission.

40:18.940 --> 40:19.380
Don't blab.

40:19.620 --> 40:20.020
Leave.

40:20.140 --> 40:21.180
Leave now.

40:33.980 --> 40:34.580
Jiu,

40:35.900 --> 40:37.100
I hope this will help you.

40:50.360 --> 40:54.960
♪Broken walls and withered branches, trapped in the mire♪

40:55.240 --> 40:57.720
♪Yet still striving to reach for the sky♪

40:57.760 --> 41:01.800
♪My pride is torn down and my body is sacrificed♪

41:04.040 --> 41:06.160
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

41:06.240 --> 41:08.200
♪And roars in the blaze♪

41:08.280 --> 41:11.520
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

41:11.680 --> 41:13.920
♪Fate imprisons me♪

41:14.080 --> 41:18.880
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

41:18.880 --> 41:23.080
♪Even if hope is faint, I remain proud♪

41:23.080 --> 41:27.360
♪A mayfly will cross the ocean, however long it takes♪

41:27.360 --> 41:32.800
♪However it ends up, I'll go my own way♪

41:32.800 --> 41:34.760
♪With no fear of the distance♪

41:34.760 --> 41:38.480
♪Born from decay, fireflies still burn♪

41:38.480 --> 41:42.920
♪With sword in hand, I'll pierce the dawn♪

41:42.920 --> 41:48.280
♪Let these scars all over me become♪

41:48.280 --> 41:51.880
♪My new pride♪

42:06.680 --> 42:09.560
♪Peril is everywhere in the palace♪

42:09.560 --> 42:12.080
♪Yet I smile to nobody but you♪

42:12.080 --> 42:14.440
♪Amidst the chaos♪

42:14.440 --> 42:18.720
♪I'll always be with you♪

